{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "API de Gestión de Remesas de Pagos/Cobros",
    "description": "API para crear remesas (account.batch.payment) en Odoo.\n\n## Autenticación\nTodos los endpoints requieren autenticación mediante API key a través de la cabecera `X-API-Key`.\n\n## Formato de Respuesta\nTodas las respuestas siguen un formato estándar con los campos `success`, `message`, y opcionalmente `data` o `error_code`.\n\n## Tipos de Remesa\n- `inbound`: Remesa de cobros (Domiciliación bancaria)\n- `outbound`: Remesa de pagos (Transferencia de crédito)\n\n## Validaciones Destacadas\n- El diario de la remesa se obtiene automáticamente de la configuración de la compañía (`pnt_default_journal_id`).\n- `journal_destiny` debe ser un diario bancario válido existente en Odoo.\n- Las facturas incluidas deben existir y tener estado de pago `not_paid` o `partial`.\n- Para cada factura se valida el residual de líneas del tipo correcto (`asset_receivable` para inbound, `liability_payable` para outbound).\n- El importe de cada línea debe coincidir exactamente con el importe residual validado de la factura.\n- La suma de los residuales de todas las facturas debe coincidir con el campo `amount` de la cabecera.\n- Para remesas `inbound`, el campo `sdd_required_collection_date` es obligatorio.\n- `method_id` es opcional en la petición.\n- El método de pago se selecciona automáticamente priorizando SEPA (`sepa_direct_debit` para inbound, `sepa_ct` para outbound).\n\n## Códigos de Error\n- `INVALID_API_KEY`: Autenticación fallida\n- `INVALID_PARAMETERS`: Error de validación (estado 400)\n- `INVALID_FOREIGN_KEY`: Violación de clave foránea (estado 400)\n- `MISSING_CONFIGURATION`: Configuración del servidor faltante (estado 422)\n- `DUPLICATE_KEY_VALUE`: Recurso duplicado (estado 409)\n- `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR`: Error inesperado (estado 500)\n",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Punt Sistemes"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "{protocol}://{host}:{port}{basePath}",
      "description": "Configuración Personalizada del Servidor",
      "variables": {
        "protocol": {
          "enum": [
            "http",
            "https"
          ],
          "default": "http",
          "description": "Protocolo (http o https)"
        },
        "host": {
          "default": "localhost",
          "description": "Nombre de host o dirección IP del servidor"
        },
        "port": {
          "default": "8069",
          "description": "Número de puerto del servidor"
        },
        "basePath": {
          "default": "/api/v1",
          "description": "Ruta base de la API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-API-Key",
        "description": "API key para autenticación"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "PaymentOrderLineSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "invoice_id",
          "amount"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "invoice_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID de la factura en Odoo."
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "exclusiveMinimum": true,
            "description": "Importe a pagar/cobrar. Debe ser estrictamente >0 y coincidir con el residual."
          }
        }
      },
      "PaymentOrderCreateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "pnt_erp_id",
          "batch_type",
          "date",
          "journal_destiny",
          "name",
          "amount",
          "lines"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "pnt_erp_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "Identificador único del sistema ERP (>0)."
          },
          "batch_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "inbound",
              "outbound"
            ],
            "description": "Tipo de remesa: inbound (cobro) u outbound (pago)."
          },
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Fecha de la remesa (YYYY-MM-DD)."
          },
          "sdd_required_collection_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Fecha solicitada de cobro (obligatorio para inbound)."
          },
          "journal_destiny": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del diario destino en Odoo (>0)."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "description": "Referencia de la remesa (Total Remesa)."
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "Importe total de la remesa (debe coincidir con la suma de las líneas)."
          },
          "method_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del método de pago de Odoo (opcional)."
          },
          "lines": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaymentOrderLineSchema"
            },
            "description": "Lista de facturas a incluir en la remesa."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/payment_orders": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Crear Remesa de Cobros/Pagos",
        "description": "Crea una remesa (account.batch.payment) y sus pagos asociados.\n\nValidaciones específicas:\n1. **Diario Origen**: Se usa el configurado en la compañía (`pnt_default_journal_id`).\n2. **Diario Destino**: Se valida `journal_destiny`.\n3. **Facturas**: Se verifica estado (`not_paid`/`partial`) y coincidencia de importe con residual.\n4. **Totales**: Se valida que la suma de líneas coincida con el total de la remesa.\n5. **Método de Pago**: Se auto-selecciona `sepa_direct_debit` (inbound) o `sepa_ct` (outbound).\n",
        "operationId": "create_payment_order",
        "tags": [
          "Payment Orders"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaymentOrderCreateRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "inbound": {
                  "summary": "Remesa inbound",
                  "value": {
                    "pnt_erp_id": 9001,
                    "batch_type": "inbound",
                    "date": "2026-02-15",
                    "sdd_required_collection_date": "2026-02-20",
                    "journal_destiny": 7,
                    "name": "REMESA-FEB-001",
                    "amount": 1500.5,
                    "lines": [
                      {
                        "invoice_id": 101,
                        "amount": 500.25
                      },
                      {
                        "invoice_id": 102,
                        "amount": 1000.25
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "outbound": {
                  "summary": "Remesa outbound",
                  "value": {
                    "pnt_erp_id": 9002,
                    "batch_type": "outbound",
                    "date": "2026-02-15",
                    "journal_destiny": 7,
                    "name": "REMESA-FEB-002",
                    "amount": 250.0,
                    "method_id": 3,
                    "lines": [
                      {
                        "invoice_id": 201,
                        "amount": 250.0
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Remesa creada correctamente",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Record created successfully",
                  "data": {
                    "odoo_id": 305,
                    "erp_id": 9001,
                    "values": {
                      "pnt_erp_id": 9001,
                      "batch_type": "inbound",
                      "date": "2026-02-15",
                      "sdd_required_collection_date": "2026-02-20",
                      "journal_destiny": 7,
                      "name": "REMESA-FEB-001",
                      "amount": 1500.5
                    },
                    "metadata": [
                      {
                        "company_id": 1,
                        "company_name": "Compañía Principal"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Solicitud incorrecta - Errores de validación",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "invalid_amount_mismatch": {
                    "summary": "Importe no coincide con residual",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "lines"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Invoice 101: amount 500.0 does not match residual 500.25",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "total_mismatch": {
                    "summary": "Total remesa no coincide con suma de residuales",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "lines"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Total residual 1500.5 does not match batch amount 1500.0",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "missing_sdd_date": {
                    "summary": "Falta fecha cobro en inbound",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "sdd_required_collection_date"
                            ],
                            "msg": "sdd_required_collection_date is required when batch_type is 'inbound'",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invoice_not_found": {
                    "summary": "Factura no encontrada",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "lines"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Invoice not found: 999",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_payment_state": {
                    "summary": "Estado de pago de factura inválido",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "lines"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Invoice 101 has invalid payment state: 'paid'. Expected: not_paid or partial",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "no_payment_method": {
                    "summary": "Sin método de pago disponible para el diario",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "loc": [
                              "journal_id"
                            ],
                            "msg": "No payment method available for batch_type 'inbound' in journal 'Banco'",
                            "type": "value_error"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No autorizado",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "INVALID_API_KEY",
                  "message": "Invalid or missing API key"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Conflicto - ERP ID duplicado",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "DUPLICATE_KEY_VALUE",
                  "message": "Record with provided key already exists"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Configuración faltante - Diario no configurado",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "MISSING_CONFIGURATION",
                  "message": "Required server configuration is missing: pnt_default_journal_id"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Error interno del servidor",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR",
                  "message": "An internal server error occurred"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
